<%- include("../../partials/breadcrumb-nav") %>

<article class="layout-container">
    <h2 class="generic-heading__row">World Breastfeeding Week Awareness Programme</h2>
    <h5>1st - 7th August 2025</h5>

    <div class="generic-heading__row">
        <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
            <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
            <h3>Programme Overview</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="__divider">
            <div class="__line"></div>
            <div class="__dot"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p>Bright School & College of Nursing organized an awareness programme...</p>

    <section>
        <div class="generic-heading__row">

            <h3>Programme Invitation</h3>

            <div class="__divider">
                <div class="__line"></div>
                <div class="__dot"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <img src="/images/educational-programmes/breastfeeding-week/Invitation 2.webp" alt="Program Invitation"
            loading="lazy">

        <!--Guest Lecture Heading-->
        <div class="generic-heading__row">
            <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
                <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
                <h3>Message from our Guest Speaker</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="__divider">
                <div class="__line"></div>
                <div class="__dot"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Guest Lecture -->
        <div class="generic-paragraph">
            <div class="generic-paragraph__content">
                <h5>
                    Welcome back to a promising Academic Year! Exciting
                    Opportunities await you.
                </h5>

                <p>
                    As we embark on another academic year at Bright School of Nursing. I want to express my
                    heartfelt appreciation for the dedication and resilience each of you brings. In the noble
                    pursuit of shaping compassionate and skilled healthcare professionals, your efforts contribute
                    significantly to the success and reputation of our Instituiton. Together let us continue
                    fostering an environment of excellence, innovation and empathy.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I have full confidence in the capabilities of our faculty to impart knowledge and mentor our
                    aspiring nurses to be. Your journey here is a stepping stone to a rewarding and impactful career
                    ahead. Embrace every opportunity for growth and learning. Remember good listeners are perpetual
                    learners. Seek Support when needed, and always believe in your ability to overcome obstacles.
                    Your success is not just a personal achievement but also a testament to the strength of our
                    academic community. Let us uphold the values of integrity, compassion, and professionalism that
                    defines our Instituiton.
                <p>
                    May this year bring forth achievements, camaraderie, and shared success. I am proud to lead such
                    a dedicated community, and I look forward to witnessing the continued accomplishments of our
                    nursing college.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>
                        Wishing you a journey filled with success, personal growth and the realization of your dreams.
                    </strong>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Guest Photo -->
            <aside class="director-profile">
                <img src="/images/Director Photos.png" loading="lazy"
                    alt="Dr. Nilamadhab Jena, Past President IAP, Odisha" class="director-profile__image">
                <div class="director-profile__info">
                    <span class="director-profile__salutation">Speaker</span>
                    <span>Dr. Nilamadhab Jena</span>
                    <span>Past President IAP, Odisha</span>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <section>
            <div class="generic-heading__row">

                <h3 id="guest-lecturer">Presentation Slides</h3>

                <div class="__divider">
                    <div class="__line"></div>
                    <div class="__dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <br>

            <iframe src="/documents/Breast Feeding.pdf" width="100%" height="600" style="border:none;">
            </iframe>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Programme Gallery -->
        <section>
            <div class="generic-heading__row">

                <h4>Programme Gallery</h4>

                <div class="__divider">
                    <div class="__line"></div>
                    <div class="__dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="director-videos">
                <div class="layout-container">
                    <div class="director-videos__grid">
                        <div class="video-card">01</div>
                        <div class="video-card">02</div>
                        <div class="video-card">09</div>
                        <div class="video-card">10</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </section>
</article>